findings.remediation:
Replace `oauth_token` with `oidc_token` in the `http_target` block of `google_cloud_scheduler_job.backup`, and set `service_account_email` to a dedicated SA that has only `roles/run.invoker` on `google_cloud_run_v2_job.default`. Remove the `oauth_token` block entirely:

  oidc_token {
    audience              = "https://${var.region}-run.googleapis.com/"
    service_account_email = google_service_account.scheduler_invoker.email
  }
